{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5b2e0555b0a0689057b525bc09329d106724ae330b7ee2e7b0ab597370f4bf16", "ja": "（『聖ミリオン女学園』は観客の好評を受け、\n舞台挨拶イベントがあちこちで開催されている）", "zh": "（《圣百万女学园》受到观众好评，舞台问候活动正在各地陆续举办）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "cdaca42f0730298d94e5f7e3781da20761df69de33cc70fa29fc3a3bbd615c9a", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れー！\n舞台挨拶って、これでおしまい？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦！\n舞台问候活动到这次就结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7f824d5756d0a0989038832e85bd4217638fadf6f01fdd69d0c1f0f912845b5b", "ja": "ああ。依頼がもちろんあれば検討するけど、\nいったん今回で一区切りだ。", "zh": "对。如果有委托的话当然会考虑，不过这次暂时就告一段落了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "1b047e620a6aae9e9bfd595c668ad8e2def8dd162da2a766677ab11ca1dd986c", "ja": "そっか。\n……なんていうか、終わっちゃったなー。", "zh": "这样啊。\n……怎么说呢，结束了啊——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1004_p", "source_sha256": "9a8e101e78c644093d16b05d8532dd1d2d5b92883ef22456638672bb8986be20", "ja": "そうだな。卒業は、\nドラマとしても一区切り感があるし……。", "zh": "是啊。毕业这件事，\n作为一部剧来说也有种告一段落的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f71da9dc2158b23814db23bac9c0e3edecab3b23e9342c1785b3ab6d7dc46ff0", "ja": "昴は、どうだった？\nお嬢様学校の生徒を演じてみた感想は。", "zh": "昴感觉怎么样？\n演了贵族学校的学生，有什么感想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "0eedf0a3cb5722fef4badd0b54ecdc3743244beecdde2ed4e465b433aa393341", "ja": "うーん。最初は、けっこう大変だったかも？\n「わたし」って言うの、やっぱ照れちゃうし……。", "zh": "嗯……一开始可能确实挺辛苦的？\n要我说“我”，果然还是会觉得害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "341b609a32f1d1ffc7b00612dd0cfe75357a5347fe5c3c9a747e0334f3e87e12", "ja": "でもなんか、終わるってなるとさ……。\nなんていうか……はぁ……。", "zh": "不过啊，一想到要结束了……\n该怎么说呢……唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8e1bfcc9f0d68bb8bfc87c085077fa577ede9bf84e644f6e1b9fa73b876cdcff", "ja": "たしかに、少し寂しいかもしれないな。", "zh": "确实，或许会有点寂寞吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "1dae7e7670c72033b14bac3d3149a1b1ff3b79e3af3eec869f64a34bd10472b1", "ja": "そうなんだよなー。\n別に、役が終わるのなんて初めてじゃないのに。", "zh": "就是这样啊——\n明明也不是第一次结束饰演的角色了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "3e56729940cb510d3825b54a0af5611e6b09f27291e28ccca2c380d41500d171", "ja": "自分でもよくわかんないんだけど、なんかさー。\nなんでこんな、寂しい？感じがするんだろうなー。", "zh": "我自己也说不清楚，就是觉得啊——。\n为什么会有种这么寂寞的感觉呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2bd6a06f1530b38bcf42aaceeba9b0a041f6f9a8f67d81d3a0986e7ccd903c54", "ja": "ずっと一緒だったからじゃないか？\n千早と可憐と、3人のジャスミン姉妹として。", "zh": "不就是因为一直都在一起吗？作为千早、可怜和3人组成的茉莉姐妹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "c752000d42757d93794134e7603f056a75b597db6b4a8fac77870275f1883e06", "ja": "ジャスミン姉妹として……そっか。\nうん、そうかも……。", "zh": "作为茉莉姐妹……这样啊。\n嗯，或许是吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "db74d3def89c959b6e9e84ddf86fca173b1b206fd67a63967ae88a4e877634f1", "ja": "撮影中も、千早と可憐と同じ学校に通ってるみたいで\nすっげー楽しかったし。それに……。", "zh": "拍摄期间，感觉就像和千早、可怜在同一所学校上学一样，特别开心。而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "7edca698c19d921fbad4f268301457ea4159664d776d42cecdb06fc7a3e28b51", "ja": "なぁ、{$P$}。終わったんだから、\nいつもどおりに戻ったほうがいいよな？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}。既然拍摄结束了，还是恢复平时的样子比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1015_p", "source_sha256": "efb301959cfac57134ccbeb74b432bcd6da5f4de7b7e8b09fcf5daa33ff490fc", "ja": "いつもどおり？", "zh": "像平常那样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "00cfe8d994f5287eb855062617a2271b09ed2307e0fd374d9547093b8a9c4a14", "ja": "えっと……あー、なんかハズいんだけど！\nもう、ふたりに甘えないほうがいいよなって……。", "zh": "那个……啊——总觉得有点不好意思！\n我想……不能再一直依赖你们两个了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "6dac4578658461fd702fafe563cf794ed1c3b853bd798bff48ef543223573ad2", "ja": "撮影中、ふたりともすっごく優しくて……。\nその、本当の姉ちゃんみたいだったっていうか……。", "zh": "拍摄的时候，你们两位都特别温柔……。\n那个，就好像亲姐姐一样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "657c007c8ed8ac2f771228478ed00fbfdd2e86e7152bb0f7a5c20677b6e5bf71", "ja": "オレ、姉ちゃんもほしかったからさ……。\nそれがなくなると、なんか……ちょっと……。", "zh": "我也一直想要个姐姐的……。\n要是连这个都没有了，总觉得……有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1019_p", "source_sha256": "cee0be4dd29d6e46dc7624e9bf6d9abbbf3855bb928cb22794bed2f8343748ab", "ja": "なんだ、そんな事か。\n別に、無理に戻さなくたっていいんじゃないか？", "zh": "怎么，就这事啊。\n没必要非得勉强恢复吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1020_p", "source_sha256": "53d4981a3de39f3a9484bfdaf1e3d0ecde307764458c2ae482e107884144a000", "ja": "役としては区切りがついたけど、だからって\n関係性まで、終わりにする必要はないと思うよ。", "zh": "虽然角色告一段落了，但我觉得\n没必要连彼此的关系也一并画上句号吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "a10b2b057395c7993f3316aa4dfcaa432afb5e6fd090a4ef46dccb34d4b5ffec", "ja": "うん……そうだよな！　わかった！\nありがとな、{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯……说得也是啊！我知道了！\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0593_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "c738aa6db3785473f173d41bf62c681e380e5fa14103cc9675fea8cc43b4bbd7", "ja": "よし！　これからも、いっぱい甘えてやるぜ！\nへへっ♪", "zh": "好！以后我也要好好跟你撒娇！\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
